    <briefdescription>
<para>An <ref refid="classllvm_1_1mca_1_1_inst_ref" kindref="compound">InstRef</ref> contains both a <ref refid="structllvm_1_1mca_1_1_source_mgr" kindref="compound">SourceMgr</ref> index and <ref refid="classllvm_1_1mca_1_1_instruction" kindref="compound">Instruction</ref> pair. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The index is used as a unique identifier for the instruction. MCA will make use of this index as a key throughout MCA. </para>
